<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20969" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">horrĭfĭcus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		horror-facio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that causes tremor</i> or <i>terror</i>, <i>terrible</i>, <i>dreadful</i>, <i>frightful</i>, <i>horrific</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in postAug.
			prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bustum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					3, 906</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">letum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 12, 851</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ruinae (Aetnae),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 571</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapsu (Harpyiarum),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 225</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulmen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 2, 97</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3,
					423</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caesaries,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					2, 372</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">poena,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					20, 1</span></i>
			
			<i>fin.— Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">horrĭfĭcē</span></b> , <i>in a manner to cause dread</i>, <i>with affright</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">horrifice fertur divinae Matris imago,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					2, 609</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">4,
		36</span></i>.</div>
